  "description": "Medical.Net DICOM on fo-dicom: metadata, VOI window/level rendering on the Rust kernels, Hounsfield statistics, JPEG / JPEG-LS / JPEG 2000 / HT-J2K / RLE codecs (fo-dicom.Codecs), volumes with MPR / MIP / MinIP / oblique slabs, surface-nets isosurfaces to STL / OBJ, DICOM Segmentation and TID 1500 Measurement Report (SR), 12-lead ECG waveform, PS3.15 de-identification, synthetic CT phantoms, DICOMweb and DIMSE C-ECHO / C-STORE.",
